WEBVTT

00:06:58.676 --> 00:07:02.116
but it will also forget
to call your mother,

00:07:02.156 --> 00:07:04.116
where you put those glasses,

00:07:04.156 --> 00:07:06.636
and what you ate for lunch last Tuesday.

00:07:06.676 --> 00:07:11.916
Frustrating, but not a cause
for diagnosis, panic or shame.

00:07:11.956 --> 00:07:16.356
Most of what we forget
is just a normal part of being human.

00:07:16.356 --> 00:07:17.516
Thank you.

00:07:18.276 --> 00:07:20.436
David Biello: I will stand in
for the audience

00:07:20.476 --> 00:07:22.596
to give you my own
personal standing ovation.

00:07:22.636 --> 00:07:25.556
I personally feel so much better.

00:07:25.596 --> 00:07:26.796
So thank you for that.

00:07:26.836 --> 00:07:29.516
I think we all get a little concerned
about our memories,

00:07:29.516 --> 00:07:31.676
particularly after this pandemic.